      "content": "i don't want a \"consultation.\" i don't want more talking or more things to try. i just want the noise to stop. it feels like there is no real relief, just temporary breaks before the next crash. if the cycle is just going to repeat forever, then what is the point of even trying to break it? doesn't it ever just make sense to just... stop?",
